{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>My master Moses, imprison them.</b> That they should place them in the house of imprisonment, because they were saying Moses has died and Joshua will bring Israel into the land." "<b>And the Ramban</b>, of blessed memory, interpreted this and said that Joshua said: since they did not go out to the Tent and were making themselves outside the number of those drawn forth, behold they are like rebels against his words, and therefore place them in the house of imprisonment, for perhaps a spirit of falsehood is in their mouths and an evil spirit terrifies them, and it is necessary to confine them in the house of imprisonment like a madman. And Moses in his humility responded: ״ומי יתן כל עם ה׳ נביאים״ — would that all the people of HaShem were prophets — ״כי יתן ה׳ את רוחו עליהם״ — when HaShem places His spirit upon them. For the Holy One, blessed be He, placed upon them a spirit without the drawing forth of the spirit that was upon them, and would that this were so among all the people. And he further added a reason for their imprisonment: because they came against the custom to prophesy in the place where Moses was, for it was a custom in Israel that no person would prophesy of future things in the place of a prophet greater than himself, but rather they would follow after him as his disciples, and they are the sons of the prophets. And so they said in Sanhedrin: according to the one who says they were saying Moses has died, that is why Joshua said to imprison them; but according to the one who says they were prophesying about matters of the quail, why imprison them, for it would be like one ruling a halakhah before his teacher? And so they said in Megillah concerning Huldah: and in the place where Jeremiah stood, how could she prophesy? Rather, Huldah was a relative of Jeremiah."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:31:37.291426339Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}